Error [jet.ArgumentCountMismatch]: `on_rollback` needs a zero-parameter lambda, got 1 parameter
  --> tests/ui/effects/transact_on_rollback_needs_zero_param_lambda.jet:2:36
    |
  2 |     #Transact(tx) { tx.on_rollback(fn(n: Int) { print("{n}") }) }
    |                                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The hook body takes no arguments — it captures what it needs via closure
 Fix: Write `<handle>.on_rollback(fn() { … })` with no parameters
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0104
